A struct that embeds the core.Driver interface AND declares its own Send
(decorator): the Candidate must be the declared (drivers.Audited).Send, not
a promoted wrapper, and inside it a.Driver.Send has the one Candidate
stored in the field (Push). Expected: opaque errors.New "push: negative
priority" wrapped by "audited: %w"; two dynamic hops, each 1 of 1
candidates. ErrPager (held by the other embedding struct, Logged) absent.
-- args --
dispatch/fanout.go:@audited
